      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LET'S ENJOY THIS (2) was a strong course and distance winner last time, claiming a TG1-4W in a powerful 19.69 and a new PB here. In winning form and can measure up again. JOHNNY SPROCKETS (4) won again and recorded an impressive time after leading them home to bring up three wins in a row at this track over 342m (19.78). Solid beginner who can clear the tricky draw. Sure to measure up. WATCH AND SEE (8) has a strong record this trip with six wins and three placings from 10 starts. In the money last time at Murray Bridge Straight (19.32) in a Grade 5, finishing a nose second. Looks one of the chances. KOOKABURRA EMILY (6) picked up a cheque last time and is in the mix again.",
